{"id":2212,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年4月26日09：00时，航空宇航学院学生会联合中北大学青年廉洁社，在11216T教室举办“航空宇航学院廉洁讲坛”。本次讲坛由中北大学青年廉洁社刘于坤同学主讲，航空宇航学院部分本科生参与。</p><p>活动以学生干部廉洁警示短片开篇，通过评优偏袒、经费滥用等贴近校园生活的典型案例，引出对学生“微权力”规范使用的深刻反思，引导在场同学正视岗位责任、警惕侥幸心理、筑牢廉洁思想防线，从源头上划清行为红线。随后，主讲人重点破除“学生干部无实权、廉洁与己无关”“小节无关紧要”“廉洁是唱高调”三类认知误区，阐释廉洁作为立身之本的内涵与重要性，并提出“心有所畏、言有所戒、行有所止、引领风尚”四点践行要求，呼吁大家敬畏规则、守住底线，主动接受监督，带头营造清朗校园风气，以青春正气助力清廉校园建设。</p><p>此次活动引导同学们以案例为警醒，将廉洁理念内化于心、外化于行，强化了学生干部的廉洁自律意识，推动校园清风正气建设，帮助青年学子筑牢思想防线、扣好人生第一粒扣子。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VnRG2YU8L4U478Ld46RUznVL4laM77-aLz-bUzU8o778Lz90gihFp2hmCIa0U1y4LYhfLkyZL8-bnm-iL4r7M462nN-bLNlZUzAkMm6kn7nFLR-DLRLYMNrFUl-bUl7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLRUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10047&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B33A083B9F2535D77FFB92E8A8B67BDD/0260326E/AB9AA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VoRl2PM49YLzvYUdz9anzU4UNV7L4C-DMRLaMRV7Um7PL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaMkyPnShVLlCanRT7Uzn2UmvDnzl4LR9YMmUZMlWfnNVFnmn2UmCZLRfFLzMfol7bgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRG8MYbw62W8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10047&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vnzf2Roz9aU4N4odRCsoRMfnm67Mzl-iUzrRUNLDLNliM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4oky4okyDoRNbMR7aU462MR7Zn7-4UzCbLR7DollZLRWFMNrkMzVVMmAFUzLsU4UJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLRUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10047&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C38386899410C7F418DB3A690169E802/6EB51E68/A37C4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUNM2VUmUYU8UZodlQ2LmGDMm62nzG-ZMlQ2M4lDnmG4nmL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDnShkLkhkM7lbUNn7U4LZL7UDo7nfMN-YM4NYoRv4nRrFnm7YozffMzAFLzU8MzW2gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRG8MYbw62W8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10047&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VnRG2YU8L4U478Ld46RUznVL4laM77-aLz-bUzU8o778Lz90gihFp2hmCIa0U1y4LYhfLkyZL8-bnm-iL4r7M462nN-bLNlZUzAkMm6kn7nFLR-DLRLYMNrFUl-bUl7Jv2bjo4Oe